## encounters_clean
| Column | Type | Key | Description and rules |
|---|---|---|---|
| Encounter_ID | Text | PK | Unique visit ID |
| Patient_ID | Text | FK | → patients (never NULL) |
| Department_ID | Text | FK | → departments; NULL if unknown |
