## patient_flow_events_clean
| Column | Type | Key | Description and rules |
|---|---|---|---|
| Flow_Event_ID | Text | PK | Unique event ID |
| Encounter_ID | Text | FK | → encounters |
| Event_Type | Text | | Registration / Triage / Doctor / Bed / Discharge / Unknown. At most one of each per encounter |
| Event_Start_Time | DateTime | | When the patient joined the queue for that step |
| Event_End_Time | DateTime | | When the step finished; NULL if cancelled |
| Department_ID | Text | FK | → departments |
| Assigned_Staff_ID | Text | FK | → staff |
| Waiting_Time_Minutes | Integer | | Minutes waited before the step started; never longer than the whole step |
| Event_Status | Text | | Completed / Delayed / Cancelled / Unknown |

`Delayed` is set when the wait passes the step's limit: registration and triage > 15 min; doctor > 10 / 30 / 60 / 90 min for Critical / High / Medium / Low; bed > 120 min; discharge > 90 min.

