## Calculated measures used in the analysis
| Measure | Definition |
|---|---|
| Staffing gap | Required − Available (doctors or nurses) |
| Coverage % | Available ÷ Required × 100 |
| Bed utilisation % | Occupied bed-hours ÷ (beds × hours in the period) × 100 |
| Delayed % | Delayed steps ÷ (Completed + Delayed steps) × 100 |
| Readmission % | Encounters with Readmission_Flag = Yes ÷ all encounters × 100 |
| Estimated overtime cost | Overtime_Hours × Hourly_Cost × 1.5 (assumed rate) |
| Estimated labour cost | Actual_Hours × Hourly_Cost |
| Door-to-doctor time | Minutes from Admission_DateTime to the Doctor event start, plus the wait |
